.SH NAME
niac-scenario - Manage built-in scenarios


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBniac scenario [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List, show, and copy the built-in scenarios that ship with NIAC.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for scenario


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--storage-keep\fP=500
	Run history records to keep, pruned oldest first on start (0 keeps every run)

.PP
\fB--storage-path\fP=""
	Path to NIAC run history database (default: ~/.niac/niac.db)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  # List all available scenarios
  niac scenario list

  # Show scenario contents
  niac scenario show basic-network

  # Create config from scenario
  niac scenario use small-office office.yaml

  # Apply scenario directly (validate and display info)
  niac scenario apply data-center
.EE


